# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm preview` (wrangler dev), or to .env for
# `pnpm dev`. On stage and prod each is the product's Orun secret of the same
# name, which the deploy sets on the Worker (README). Every one is optional.

# The key nuxt-auth-utils seals the session cookie with (32 characters or
# more). Unset, it is the one the 020_app_secrets migration generated in the
# site's D1 database (run `pnpm db:migrate:local` locally).
NUXT_SESSION_PASSWORD=

# GitHub sign-in: a GitHub OAuth app's client id and secret, its callback URL
# https://<the site>/auth/github. Unset, the chat works without an account
# (each visitor's chats belong to their session), and uploads and dictation,
# which need one, are off.
NUXT_OAUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
NUXT_OAUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=

# The Vercel AI Gateway's key. Unset, the chat answers with Workers AI's
# models through the Worker's AI binding; set, the template's own models
# (Claude, Gemini, GPT through the gateway), web search and dictation appear.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
